# Change handoff

Before the final response on a task that added a feature, fixed a bug, or otherwise changed behavior, read and follow `.cursor/skills/change-handoff/SKILL.md`.

Skip when the task was a question, a review, or a plan with no behavior change, or when the only edits are formatting, comments, or docs. Skip when the user asks not to include the handoff.
